Feature: Accept a transfer
  Only the recipient accepts a transfer, within 72 hours of the offer and until 2 hours before the event starts.

  Scenario Outline: The recipient gets a new ISSUED ticket code for the same place, and the old code is VOID
    When I run "accept_transfer" with:
      | transfer_id                          | caller                                                                        | called_at   | stored_transfer                                                                                                                                                                                               | stored_ticket                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | show                                                                                                                                                                                            |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d | {"caller_id": "cy", "caller_email": "cy@example.com", "caller_role": "buyer"} | <called_at> | {"transfer_id": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d", "ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "recipient_email": "cy@example.com", "offered_at": "2026-12-01T19:00:00Z", "accept_until": "2026-12-04T19:00:00Z"} | {"ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "buyer_id": "ada", "place_kind": "seated", "section": "A1", "row": "C", "seat_number": 12, "ticket_status": "TRANSFER_PENDING", "price": {"amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "USD"}} | {"event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "organizer_id": "org-1", "starts_at": "2026-12-12T20:00:00Z", "time_zone": "Europe/Paris", "local_starts_at": "2026-12-12T21:00:00+01:00"} |
    Then the output is "accepted_transfer":
      | new_ticket                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       | void_ticket                                                  | ticket_transferred                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
      | {"ticket_code": "ABCDEFGHJKLMNPAA", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "buyer_id": "cy", "place_kind": "seated", "section": "A1", "row": "C", "seat_number": 12, "ticket_status": "ISSUED", "price": {"amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "USD"}} | {"ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "ticket_status": "VOID"} | {"message_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "ticket_code": "ABCDEFGHJKLMNPAA", "void_ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "occurred_at": "<called_at>"} |

    Examples:
      | called_at            |
      | 2026-12-02T10:00:00Z |
      | 2026-12-04T19:00:00Z |

  Scenario: An acceptance more than 72 hours after the offer is refused with TRANSFER_EXPIRED
    When I run "accept_transfer" with:
      | transfer_id                          | caller                                                                        | called_at                | stored_transfer                                                                                                                                                                                               | stored_ticket                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | show                                                                                                                                                                                            |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d | {"caller_id": "cy", "caller_email": "cy@example.com", "caller_role": "buyer"} | 2026-12-04T19:00:00.001Z | {"transfer_id": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d", "ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "recipient_email": "cy@example.com", "offered_at": "2026-12-01T19:00:00Z", "accept_until": "2026-12-04T19:00:00Z"} | {"ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "buyer_id": "ada", "place_kind": "seated", "section": "A1", "row": "C", "seat_number": 12, "ticket_status": "TRANSFER_PENDING", "price": {"amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "USD"}} | {"event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "organizer_id": "org-1", "starts_at": "2026-12-12T20:00:00Z", "time_zone": "Europe/Paris", "local_starts_at": "2026-12-12T21:00:00+01:00"} |
    Then the output is "transfer_expired":
      | transfer_id                          | accept_until         |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d | 2026-12-04T19:00:00Z |

  Scenario: An acceptance 2 hours before the start is refused with TRANSFER_WINDOW_CLOSED
    When I run "accept_transfer" with:
      | transfer_id                          | caller                                                                        | called_at            | stored_transfer                                                                                                                                                                                               | stored_ticket                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | show                                                                                                                                                                                            |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d | {"caller_id": "cy", "caller_email": "cy@example.com", "caller_role": "buyer"} | 2026-12-12T18:00:00Z | {"transfer_id": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d", "ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "recipient_email": "cy@example.com", "offered_at": "2026-12-11T19:00:00Z", "accept_until": "2026-12-14T19:00:00Z"} | {"ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "buyer_id": "ada", "place_kind": "seated", "section": "A1", "row": "C", "seat_number": 12, "ticket_status": "TRANSFER_PENDING", "price": {"amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "USD"}} | {"event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "organizer_id": "org-1", "starts_at": "2026-12-12T20:00:00Z", "time_zone": "Europe/Paris", "local_starts_at": "2026-12-12T21:00:00+01:00"} |
    Then the output is "transfer_window_closed":
