      | ABCDEFGH23456789 | 2026-12-12T20:00:00Z |

  Scenario: An unknown transfer is refused with TRANSFER_NOT_FOUND
    When I run "accept_transfer" with:
      | transfer_id                          | caller                                                                        | called_at            |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d | {"caller_id": "cy", "caller_email": "cy@example.com", "caller_role": "buyer"} | 2026-12-02T10:00:00Z |
    Then the output is "transfer_not_found":
      | transfer_id                          |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d |

  Scenario Outline: A caller who is not the recipient is refused with FORBIDDEN
    When I run "accept_transfer" with:
      | transfer_id                          | caller   | called_at            | stored_transfer                                                                                                                                                                                               | stored_ticket                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | show                                                                                                                                                                                            |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d | <caller> | 2026-12-02T10:00:00Z | {"transfer_id": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d", "ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "recipient_email": "cy@example.com", "offered_at": "2026-12-01T19:00:00Z", "accept_until": "2026-12-04T19:00:00Z"} | {"ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "buyer_id": "ada", "place_kind": "seated", "section": "A1", "row": "C", "seat_number": 12, "ticket_status": "TRANSFER_PENDING", "price": {"amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "USD"}} | {"event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "organizer_id": "org-1", "starts_at": "2026-12-12T20:00:00Z", "time_zone": "Europe/Paris", "local_starts_at": "2026-12-12T21:00:00+01:00"} |
    Then the output is "forbidden":
      | caller_id   |
      | <caller_id> |

    Examples:
      | caller_id | caller                                                                          |
      | ada       | {"caller_id": "ada", "caller_role": "buyer"}                                    |
      | dee       | {"caller_id": "dee", "caller_email": "dee@example.com", "caller_role": "buyer"} |

  Scenario Outline: A transfer whose ticket is not TRANSFER_PENDING is refused with INVALID_TICKET_STATE
    When I run "accept_transfer" with:
      | transfer_id                          | caller                                                                        | called_at            | stored_transfer                                                                                                                                                                                               | stored_ticket | show                                                                                                                                                                                            |
      | 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d | {"caller_id": "cy", "caller_email": "cy@example.com", "caller_role": "buyer"} | 2026-12-02T10:00:00Z | {"transfer_id": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d", "ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "recipient_email": "cy@example.com", "offered_at": "2026-12-01T19:00:00Z", "accept_until": "2026-12-04T19:00:00Z"} | <ticket>      | {"event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "organizer_id": "org-1", "starts_at": "2026-12-12T20:00:00Z", "time_zone": "Europe/Paris", "local_starts_at": "2026-12-12T21:00:00+01:00"} |
    Then the output is "invalid_ticket_state":
      | ticket_code      | ticket_status |
      | ABCDEFGH23456789 | <status>      |

